# Line-ending policy: this repo is LF-only.
#
# A contributor's core.autocrlf=true (a Windows-oriented setting) once rewrote every
# checked-out text file to CRLF in the worktree. Bash, sh, just and Docker treat the
# carriage return as a literal character, which broke the deploy scripts. These rules
# force LF in index and worktree no matter what the client's core.autocrlf says.
# CI additionally fails if any CRLF sneaks into a commit (see ci.yml repo-lint).
*.sh         text eol=lf
*.bash       text eol=lf
Dockerfile   text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
justfile     text eol=lf
